          "kind": "security",
          "start": 36,
          "end": 39,
          "title": "Concurrent refunds can exceed the captured amount",
          "detail": "The remaining amount is checked before the transaction starts, and the update writes an absolute value. Two parallel requests can both pass the check, and the second write overwrites the first.",
